ions, each with its own unique atmosphere. Discover hidden treasures and delightful surprises as you create your perfect space!\\r\\n\\r\\nFour Engaging Game Modes:\\r\\n-Classic Mode: Unpack and place objects without mistakes for the highest score.\\r\\n-Timed Challenge: Race against the clock to arrange items before time runs out.\\r\\n-Sandbox Mode: Enjoy unlimited creativity as you unpack and arrange at your own pace.\\r\\n-Speed Run Mode: Test your skills in a fast-paced environment, focusing on quick unpacking and efficient placement.\\r\\n-Diverse Levels: Navigate through various rooms and environments, each offering fresh challenges and aesthetics.\\r\\n\\r\\nDiscover Something New: Each level reveals unique items and surprises that enhance your unpacking experience, encouraging exploration and creativity.\\r\\n\\r\\nTransform every space into a reflection of your imagination in Unpacking Dreams!", "developer": "CGI LAB", "external": {"metacritic": {"id": "1400797446"}}, "image": {}, "platforms": ["Nintendo Switch"], "publisher": "CGI LAB", "release_date": "2024-10-24", "release_year": 2024, "short_description": "Explore a whimsical world by unpacking boxes, arranging items, and discovering hidden treasures in vibrant locations.", "short_descriptions": [{"language": "de", "value": "Erkunde eine verspielte Welt, indem du Kisten auspackst, Gegenstände arrangierst und versteckte Schätze an lebendigen Orten entdeckst."}, {"language": "es", "value": "Explora un mundo mágico desempacando cajas, organizando objetos y descubriendo tesoros ocultos en lugares vibrantes."}, {"language": "fr", "value": "Explorez un monde fantaisiste en déballant des cartons, en arrangeant des objets et en découvrant des trésors cachés dans des lieux colorés."}, {"language": "en", "value": "Explore a whimsical world by unpacking boxes, arranging items, and discovering hidden treasures in vibrant locations."}]}, "popularity": 0.9520724536815194, "disambiguation": "2024-10-24, CGI LAB", "t